(7436649, 1175414, 100831, '<td valign="top">You have the incredible talent of being able to incorporate the human element and make inanimate things interesting. SO much more so than just shooting the artwork on the wall (which I''m sorry to say scored in this challenge). This deserved much better, though Jake may be right about being able to see the phone screen. I wouldn''t have thought about that myself:)</td>', 'You have the incredible talent of being able to incorporate the human element and make inanimate things interesting. SO much more so than just shooting the artwork on the wall (which I''m sorry to say scored in this challenge). This deserved much better, though Jake may be right about being able to see the phone screen. I wouldn''t have thought about that myself:)', '2016-02-12 08:59:21.000000', NULL, 0),
