(7436754, 1175451, 117474, '<td valign="top">Great to see this in the top 52. Well deserved. <br/> <br/>Apparently interesting means a four, which itself is interesting.  If I had a ribbon thing I may or may not have given one to you. <br/> <br/>Actually, I like the consistency in this. Reminds me about the shadows from Peter Pan. Somehow that shadow is living in reality rather than being a projection of it. <br/> <br/>Interesting.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-02-13 17:53:42.</i></td>', 'Great to see this in the top 52. Well deserved.  Apparently interesting means a four, which itself is interesting.  If I had a ribbon thing I may or may not have given one to you.  Actually, I like the consistency in this. Reminds me about the shadows from Peter Pan. Somehow that shadow is living in reality rather than being a projection of it.  Interesting.', '2016-02-13 06:10:49.000000', '2016-02-13 17:53:42.000000', 0),
(7436755, 1175440, 117474, '<td valign="top">Came back to this again. It''s excellent. And for me supremely sinister. It''s a face made up from the Devils horns. But while sinister in construction for me, it is not intimidating. It''s almost welcoming.</td>', 'Came back to this again. It''s excellent. And for me supremely sinister. It''s a face made up from the Devils horns. But while sinister in construction for me, it is not intimidating. It''s almost welcoming.', '2016-02-13 06:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
