(7437019, 1175003, 138630, '<td valign="top">What you NEED is to go out shooting with me sometimes.  I can show you how it''s done LOL (not the shooting part but the attitude).  This is great and of course the best parts about it are the inclusing of the rubbish bin, the wonky look and the processing.  Oh, and I like the window, too.  Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'What you NEED is to go out shooting with me sometimes.  I can show you how it''s done LOL (not the shooting part but the attitude).  This is great and of course the best parts about it are the inclusing of the rubbish bin, the wonky look and the processing.  Oh, and I like the window, too.  Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2016-02-14 14:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
