(7437187, 1175081, 25024, '<td valign="top">Well done Marcel! What an excellent result and what an excellent image, thoroughly deserved. As Sue says, it is all down to your efforts and your willingness to respond to constructive criticism in order to improve your results, I also am very proud of you very well done Marcel. First of many more to come...</td>', 'Well done Marcel! What an excellent result and what an excellent image, thoroughly deserved. As Sue says, it is all down to your efforts and your willingness to respond to constructive criticism in order to improve your results, I also am very proud of you very well done Marcel. First of many more to come...', '2016-02-15 04:39:29.000000', NULL, 0),
