(7439012, 1175003, 103142, '<td valign="top">You actually don''t need balls. We''re females. We''ve been doing without them for eons. The thing of it is: we rarely get in trouble for anything. We can take pictures of kids and not look like perverts. We''re all powerful! The guys are the creepy, suspicious-looking types. We''re too innocent looking. :)</td>', 'You actually don''t need balls. We''re females. We''ve been doing without them for eons. The thing of it is: we rarely get in trouble for anything. We can take pictures of kids and not look like perverts. We''re all powerful! The guys are the creepy, suspicious-looking types. We''re too innocent looking. :)', '2016-02-22 20:04:57.000000', NULL, 0);
